k Repairs 2026 Project Number: 121052.00 Primary Funding Source: Fix Our Streets Sales Tax Multiple Funds: Yes Council District(s): Multiple\t\t\t\t\tDepartment: Division: Contact: New Project? 1st CIP Year: Type:\tPublic Works Engineering Yes 2026 Project\t\t\t\t\t\nThis project encoumpasses bridge deck maintenance work such as concrete patching, concrete mill and overlay, and approach pavement repair/replace. Locations of repair include BB11B N. Kansas Avenue over Soldier Creek Cut-off (concrete mill/overlay), H9A S. Kansas Avenue over Shunganunga Creek (concrete deck patching), and F11H SE 6th over BNSFRR (concrete deck patching).\n\nProject Estimates\t>2025\t2026\t2027\t2028\t2029\t2030\t2031\t2032\t2033\t2034\t2035\t2036\tTotal Cost\nDesign/Admin Fees\t$ -\t$ 75,000\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ 75,000\nRight of Way\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\nConstruction/Service Fees\t$ -\t$ -\t$ 845,000\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ 845,000\nContingency\t$ -\t$ -\t$ 80,000\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ 80,000\nTechnology\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\nFinancing Costs (Temp Notes)\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\nCost of Issuance (Rev/GO Bonds)\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\nDebt Reserve Fund (Rev Bond)\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\nCapitalized Interest\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\nTotals\t$ - $ 75,000\t$ 925,000\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ 1,000,000\n\nFinancing Sources\t>2025\t2026\t2027\t2028\t2029\t2030\t2031\t2032\t2033\t2034\t2035\t2036\tTotal Cost\nG.O. Bonds\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\nRevenue Bonds\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\nARPA\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\t$ -\nFix Our S